 rkflows run with clear checkpoints for human review. Fifteen places\, and 
 a paid ChatGPT or Claude subscription is required.\n\nOrganiser: Schwyz Ne
 xt\n\nDetails and registration: https://swissdataevents.ch/events/schwyz-n
 ext-ki-agenten-work-immensee-2026/
