SUMMARY:KI-Strategie und -Governance für KMUs
LOCATION:Hohle Gasse AG\, Coworking «Connect»\, Artherstrasse 60\, Immens
 ee
DESCRIPTION:A 90-minute German-language session for SME decision-makers on 
 steering generative AI use rather than letting it spread: setting a strate
 gic frame\, drafting an internal AI policy\, weighing data-protection\, li
 ability and wrong-output risks\, and planning a safe rollout under Swiss d
 ata protection law and the EU AI Act. Fifteen places.\n\nOrganiser: Schwyz
  Next\n\nDetails and registration: https://swissdataevents.ch/events/schwy
 z-next-ki-strategie-governance-immensee-2026/
